    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. can u add a bit more on the fee structures too? like what kind of costs should the client expect to see in an etf vs a mutual fund? i want to make sure i mention any hidden or unexpected costs that might pop up.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
